{"title":"Controls","sourceTitle":"Controls/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Controls\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Controls (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Controls/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"操作/控制 (29% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.19.7</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\nVintage Story usa principalmente entradas de mouse e teclado para controles. Todos os controles listados aqui são padrões. Eles podem ser alterados através do <a href=\"/Settings\" title=\"Settings\">configurações</a> do jogo.\n</p><p><span id=\"Toggleable&#95;options\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Opções_alternáveis\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Opções alternáveis</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Lista_de_controles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Lista de controles</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Controles_do_Mouse\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Controles do Mouse</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Controles_de_movimento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Controles de movimento</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Modificadores_de_clique_do_mouse\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Modificadores de clique do mouse</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Ações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ações</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Ajuda_e_sobreposições_no_jogo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ajuda e sobreposições no jogo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Interface_de_usuário\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Interface de usuário</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Teclas_de_atalho\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Teclas de atalho</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Pilhas_de_itens\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pilhas de itens</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Modo_criativo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Modo criativo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Depuração_e_macros\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Depuração e macros</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Op.C3.A7.C3.B5es_altern.C3.A1veis\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Opções_alternáveis\">Opções alternáveis</span></h2>\n<p>Duas opções gerais afetam as teclas Sneak e Sprint e o clique estendido do mouse, por exemplo Shift + clique.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Option</th>\n<th>Effect\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alternar Sprint</td>\n<td><b>On</b>: O sprint é alternado usando a tecla Sprint - toque uma vez para ativar e toque novamente para desativar o sprint.<br /><b>Off</b>: A tecla Sprint deve ser mantida pressionada para executar. (Observação: se você achar desconfortável manter pressionada a tecla Ctrl ao mesmo tempo que <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r116235\">.mw-parser-output .keyboard-key{border:1px solid #aaa;border-radius:0.2em;box-shadow:0.1em 0.1em 0.2em rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background-color:#f9f9f9;background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#eee,#f9f9f9,#eee);color:#000;padding:0.1em 0.3em;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.85em}.mw-parser-output .nowrap{white-space:nowrap}</style><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">W</kbd> para movimento, o Sprint pode ser revertido para uma tecla diferente, por exemplo Q ou R, consulte também a descrição dos modificadores do mouse a seguir.)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Modificadores de mouse bloqueados para Sneak/Sprint</td>\n<td><b>On</b>: (Padrão) <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Shift</kbd> + ações de clique do mouse são obtidas mantendo pressionada a tecla Sneak enquanto clica. <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + ações de clique do mouse são obtidas mantendo pressionada a tecla Sprint. Se Sneak estiver vinculado à tecla Shift e Sprint estiver vinculado à tecla Ctrl, então isso pode funcionar bem. Mas se você religar Sneak ou Sprint para algo diferente - especialmente se você os inverteu para que a tecla Shift agora seja Sprint como algumas pessoas gostam de fazer - então pode ser estranho pressionar outras teclas além de Shift e Ctrl com os botões do mouse, caso em que esta configuração deve ser desligada... separadamente das teclas Sneak e Sprint. Isso permite que Sneak e Sprint sejam reconfigurados sem afetar <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Shift</kbd> e <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> para cliques do mouse. Esta configuração também pode ser usada, por exemplo, para passar a usar as teclas <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">R Shift</kbd> e <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">R Ctrl</kbd> do lado direito do teclado para cliques do mouse, o que pode ajudar na acessibilidade para pessoas que usam o mouse na mão esquerda.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"List&#95;of&#95;controls\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Lista_de_controles\">Lista de controles</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Mouse&#95;controls\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Controles_do_Mouse\">Controles do Mouse</span></h3>\n<p><i>Veja <a href=\"/Settings#Mouse/pt-br\" title=\"Settings\">Settings/Mouse</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Settings#Mouse/pt-br\" title=\"Settings\"> </a></span> para configurações adicionais relacionadas ao mouse</i>\n</p><p>Tudo isso é encontrado na guia “Mouse” no menu Configurações.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Action\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Left mouse button\" src=\"/images/0/0a/LMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span></td>\n<td>Botão principal do mouse\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span></td>\n<td>Botão secundário do mouse\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:MMB.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/f/fa/MMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Rato do meio\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>A chave de interação primária permite aos jogadores:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Quebrar blocos</li>\n<li>Use ferramentas equipadas</li>\n<li>Ataque com armas equipadas</li>\n<li>Retirar armas de longo alcance (quando seguradas)</li>\n<li>Selecione objetos nas telas de menu, como inventário, inventário de personagens e inventário criativo</li></ul>\n<p>A chave de interação secundária permite aos jogadores:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Coloque blocos</li>\n<li>Abra recipientes de armazenamento</li>\n<li>Abrir menus de fogueira</li>\n<li>Coma itens equipados (quando segurados)</li>\n<li>Coloque os itens em uma prensa de frutas</li>\n<li>Remova itens de uma forja</li>\n<li>Pegue objetos no chão, como <a href=\"/Stick\" title=\"Stick\">gravetos</a>, <a href=\"/Stone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stone\">pedras soltas</a>, e coloque recipientes vestíveis</li></ul>\n<p>Quando modificada pela tecla Sneak (ou pelo modificador Shift-click), a tecla de interação secundária permite aos jogadores:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Coloque pedras soltas, pederneira e obsidiana para <a href=\"/Knapping\" title=\"Knapping\">lascando</a></li>\n<li>Coloque <a href=\"/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">argila</a> no chão para <a href=\"/Clay_forming\" title=\"Clay forming\">moldando argila</a></li>\n<li>Coloque itens em uma forja</li>\n<li>Coloque recipientes vestíveis no chão</li>\n<li>Extraia o favo de mel em uma tigela colocada</li></ul>\n<p>Quando modificada pela tecla Executar (ou pelo modificador Ctrl-clique) <b>e</b> pela tecla Sneak (ou pelo modificador Shift-clique), a tecla de interação secundária permite aos jogadores encostar itens aplicáveis ​​contra um muro alto de dois blocos.\n</p><p><span id=\"Movement&#95;controls\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Controles_de_movimento\">Controles de movimento</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Action\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">W</kbd></td>\n<td>Seguir em frente\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">S</kbd></td>\n<td>Mover-se para trás\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">A</kbd></td>\n<td>Mover para a esquerda\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">D</kbd></td>\n<td>Mover para a direita\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Shift</kbd></td>\n<td>Esgueirar-se\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd></td>\n<td>Correr\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Space</kbd></td>\n<td>Pular\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">G</kbd></td>\n<td>Sente-se\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>O controle \"esgueirar-se\" também é usado para ativar certos itens no slot de mão inábil, como <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Shield\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Shield\">escudos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Shield\" title=\"Shield\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Mouse&#95;click&#95;modifiers\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Modificadores_de_clique_do_mouse\">Modificadores de clique do mouse</span></h3>\n<p>Visível apenas se \"Modificadores de mouse bloqueados para Sneak/Sprint\" estiver definido como <i>off</i>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Action\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Shift</kbd></td>\n<td>Clique com a tecla Shift pressionada. Alterar isso define uma tecla modificadora diferente que deve ser mantida pressionada para qualquer interação do botão Shift + Mouse, normalmente chamada de \"shift-clique\" (algumas pessoas pensam nisso como \"clique furtivo\").\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd></td>\n<td>Ctrl-clique. Alterar isso define uma tecla modificadora diferente que deve ser mantida pressionada para qualquer interação com o botão Ctrl + Mouse, normalmente chamada de \"ctrl-clique\" (algumas pessoas pensam nisso como \"sprint-clique\").\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Actions\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"A.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ações\">Ações</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Action\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">E</kbd></td>\n<td>Mochila aberta e inventário de artesanato\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">C</kbd></td>\n<td>Inventário de personagem aberto\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Q</kbd></td>\n<td>Solte um item do slot ativo do barra de atalhos\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Q</kbd></td>\n<td>Solte todos os itens do slot ativo do barra de atalhos\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F</kbd></td>\n<td>Selecione o modo ferramenta/argila. Permite que os jogadores alternem entre diferentes modos de ferramentas, como os modos <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Prospecting_pick\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Prospecting pick\">escolha de prospecção</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Prospecting_pick\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prospecting pick\"> </a></span>, ou alternem entre diferentes modos de formação de argila.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"In-game&#95;help&#95;and&#95;overlays\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Ajuda_e_sobreposi.C3.A7.C3.B5es_no_jogo\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ajuda_e_sobreposições_no_jogo\">Ajuda e sobreposições no jogo</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Action\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">V</kbd></td>\n<td>Mostrar/ocultar coordenadas e bússola\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">B</kbd></td>\n<td>Mostrar/ocultar sobreposição de informações de bloco e entidade\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">N</kbd></td>\n<td>Mostrar/ocultar sobreposição de informações de interação\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F6</kbd></td>\n<td>Mostrar/ocultar minimapa\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"User&#95;interface\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Interface_de_usu.C3.A1rio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interface_de_usuário\">Interface de usuário</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Action\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Esc</kbd></td>\n<td>Pausar jogo e configurações\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F4</kbd></td>\n<td>Mostrar/ocultar HUD\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F5</kbd></td>\n<td>Alternar câmera. Alterna entre câmera de primeira pessoa, terceira pessoa e aérea\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">-</kbd></td>\n<td>Diminua o zoom. Aplica-se apenas no modo de câmera de terceira pessoa\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">+</kbd></td>\n<td>Aumentar o zoom. Aplica-se apenas no modo de câmera de terceira pessoa\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Left Alt</kbd></td>\n<td>Bloquear/desbloquear o cursor do mouse\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">T</kbd></td>\n<td>Bate-papo: comece a digitar\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">.</kbd></td>\n<td>Bate-papo: comece a digitar um comando do cliente. Veja <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/List_of_client_commands\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/List of client commands\">Lista de comandos do cliente</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/List_of_client_commands\" title=\"List of client commands\"> </a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">/</kbd></td>\n<td>Bate-papo: comece a digitar um comando do servidor. Veja <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/List_of_server_commands\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/List of server commands\">Lista de comandos do servidor</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands\" title=\"List of server commands\"> </a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Tab</kbd></td>\n<td>Bate-papo: mostrar/ocultar caixa de diálogo de bate-papo\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">M</kbd></td>\n<td>Abra o editor de macros\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F11</kbd></td>\n<td>Alternar modo de tela cheia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F12</kbd></td>\n<td>Faça uma captura de tela. Por padrão, as capturas de tela são salvas em <code>C:\\Users\\user\\Pictures\\Vintagestory</code> como um arquivo.png\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F12</kbd></td>\n<td>Faça uma mega captura de tela. Uma mega captura de tela tem resolução duplicada em comparação com uma captura de tela normal, e o tamanho do arquivo pode ser cerca de dez vezes maior.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Hotkeys\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Teclas_de_atalho\">Teclas de atalho</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Action\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">X</kbd></td>\n<td>Troque o conteúdo da esquerda/direita. Troca itens entre o slot barra de atalhos equipado e o slot <a href=\"/Off-hand\" title=\"Off-hand\">de improviso</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">0-9</kbd></td>\n<td>Selecione o slot da barra quente\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">1-4</kbd></td>\n<td>Selecione o slot de mochila 1-4\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Stacks&#95;of&#95;items\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pilhas_de_itens\">Pilhas de itens</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Action\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Shift</kbd>+<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Left mouse button\" src=\"/images/0/0a/LMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span></td>\n<td>Transfira toda a pilha do contêiner para o seu inventário e vice-versa\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span></td>\n<td>Pegue metade da pilha\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd>+rolar <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:MMB.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/f/fa/MMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Pegue os itens um por um da pilha\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Creative&#95;mode\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Modo_criativo\">Modo criativo</span></h3>\n<p>Isso se aplica apenas ao jogar em <a href=\"/Creative\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Creative\">modo criativo</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Action\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F1</kbd></td>\n<td>-1 velocidade de voo/movimento\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F2</kbd></td>\n<td>+1 velocidade de voo/movimento\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Shift</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F1</kbd></td>\n<td>-0,1 velocidade de voo/movimento\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Shift</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F2</kbd></td>\n<td>+0,1 velocidade de voo/movimento\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F3</kbd></td>\n<td>Modo de voo de ciclo. Não voam, voam e voam sem colisão (noclip).\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Space</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Space</kbd></td>\n<td>Modo voar ativado/desativado (toque duplo)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F4</kbd></td>\n<td>Mostrar/ocultar metablocos\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span id=\"Depura.C3.A7.C3.A3o_e_macros\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Depuração_e_macros\">Depuração e macros</span></h3>\n<p>Observe que várias teclas Alt + F... podem ser substituídas pelo aplicativo Nvidia GeForce Experience, se você usá-lo. Você pode querer alterar as combinações de teclas se achar que elas não funcionam.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Action\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Alt</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F3</kbd></td>\n<td>Gráfico FPS\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F3</kbd></td>\n<td>Tela de depuração e gráfico FPS\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F1</kbd></td>\n<td>Recarregar mundo\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Alt</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F1</kbd></td>\n<td>Recarregar sombreadores\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Alt</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F2</kbd></td>\n<td>Recarregar texturas\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Alt</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F8</kbd></td>\n<td>Pilha compacta de objetos grandes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Alt</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F9</kbd></td>\n<td>Recompor todas as caixas de diálogo\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Alt</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F10</kbd></td>\n<td>Ciclo de modos de estrutura de diálogo\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F10</kbd></td>\n<td>Alternar perfil de tick\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n<span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Modo <a href=\"/Creative\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Creative\">Criativo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Macro\" title=\"Macro\">Macro</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%),