e=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knapping\" title=\"Knapping\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Clay_forming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Clay forming\">Moldando argila</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Clay_forming\" title=\"Clay forming\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\">Forjando</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\">Cozimento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">Temperatura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hunger\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hunger\">Fome</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hunger\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hunger\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mining\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mining\">Mineração</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mining\" title=\"Mining\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temporal_stability\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temporal stability\">Estabilidade temporal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temporal_stability\" title=\"Temporal stability\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical_power\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical power\">Potência mecânica</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mechanical_power\" title=\"Mechanical power\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">Comércio</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">Agricultura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Animal_h